IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hsa-licensing`

-- Healthcare Services Act 2020, ss 3, 5, 8, 9, 9A, 16, 18, 28, 29, 31, 31A, 31B, 42, 43 and First Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_healthcare-services-act-2020.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

